---
// Services Component - Fluid Precision Prototype
---

<section id="services" class="py-24 bg-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		
		<!-- Section Header -->
		<div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
			<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 block mb-2">
				Pilar Layanan Toko AL
			</span>
			<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">
				Tiga Layanan Inti untuk Setiap Pesepeda
			</h2>
			<p class="text-zinc-600 text-base mt-2">
				Semua kebutuhan gowes Anda terakomodasi di satu lokasi: unit sepeda keluarga, suku cadang original, hingga bengkel perakitan profesional.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- 3 Precision Service Cards -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
			
			<!-- Card 1 -->
			<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between group">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
							<i class="fas fa-bicycle"></i>
						</div>
						<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100/70 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
							<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span> Siap Coba di Toko
						</span>
					</div>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">
						Sepeda & Mainan Anak
					</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
						Unit sepeda lengkap untuk balap, gunung, lipat, hingga sepeda balita dan mobil mainan aki yang aman dan edukatif.
					</p>

					<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Sepeda MTB, Roadbike, & Lipat</span></li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Push Bike, Roda Tiga, & Roda Bantu</span></li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Mobil & Motor Mainan Aki Anak</span></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Card 2 -->
			<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between group">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-200 text-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
							<i class="fas fa-cogs"></i>
						</div>
						<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-zinc-700 bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
							<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-500"></span> 100% Komponen Asli
						</span>
					</div>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">
						Sparepart & Komponen
					</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
						Koleksi suku cadang original dan aksesoris keselamatan berkendara untuk menjaga kenyamanan serta performa sepeda Anda.
					</p>

					<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>RD, FD, Rantai, Sprocket, & Shifter</span></li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Ban Luar & Dalam Segala Ukuran Roda</span></li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Helm SNI, Lampu LED, & Kunci Pengaman</span></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Card 3 -->
			<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between group">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
							<i class="fas fa-wrench"></i>
						</div>
						<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100/70 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
							<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span> Mekanik di Tempat
						</span>
					</div>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">
						Bengkel Servis & Upgrade
					</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
						Pemeriksaan rutin, setting perpindahan gigi dan rem presisi, serta perakitan sepeda custom langsung oleh mekanik kami.
					</p>

					<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Tune-Up Berkala, Setting RD & Rem</span></li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Bongkar Pasang, Bearing, & Detailing</span></li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-emerald-600 text-[10px]"></i> <span>Konsultasi Keluhan Sepeda Gratis</span></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	</div>
</section>
